# Testing and Validation

This folder contains testing, validation, and commissioning documentation for the Mini Automated Sorting Conveyor.

## Current Status

Planned

Formal testing will begin as individual system functions are implemented.

## Planned Testing

Testing will eventually include:

- I/O verification
- Sensor testing
- Motor control testing
- Sorting actuator testing
- Automatic sequence testing
- Manual mode testing
- Interlock testing
- Alarm testing
- Emergency stop testing
- Fault recovery testing
- Communication testing

## Fault Testing

Fault conditions will be intentionally introduced to verify that the control system responds safely and correctly.

Potential test conditions include:

- Object sensor not detecting
- Object sensor remaining active
- Sorting actuator timeout
- Motor fault
- Communication failure
- Emergency stop activation

## FAT

A Factory Acceptance Test (FAT) procedure will be developed to verify that the system meets its functional requirements before final commissioning.

## SAT

A Site Acceptance Test (SAT) procedure will be developed to verify correct operation of the completed system.

Test procedures, expected results, actual results, and corrective actions will be documented as the project progresses.
